{
  "id": "E276",
  "title": "Ordering and Paying at the Restaurant",
  "level": "newbie",
  "date": "2018-11-29",
  "synopsis": "Ordering food and paying the bill are probably the most important survival skills in China.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/914/e145d0bd34d70ad7aa3b0f712c0cb1181b3b3c2a.mp3?1542078302",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "点菜和买单\n\n本：服务员，点菜。\n服务员：您好，请问要点什么？\n本：要这两个菜，再要一个米饭。\n服务员：好的，请稍等！\n（吃完饭后……）\n本：服务员，买单。\n服务员：您好，一共80块。",
    "traditional": "點菜和買單\n\n本：服務員，點菜。\n服務員：您好，請問要點什麼？\n本：要這兩個菜，再要一個米飯。\n服務員：好的，請稍等！\n（吃完飯後……）\n本：服務員，買單。\n服務員：您好，一共80塊。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ordering Food and Paying the Bill"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "本：服务员，点菜。",
      "traditional": "本：服務員，點菜。",
      "pinyin": "běn fú wù yuán diǎn cài",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: Waiter, I want to order."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "服务员：您好，请问要点什么？",
      "traditional": "服務員：您好，請問要點什麼？",
      "pinyin": "fú wù yuán nín hǎo qǐng wèn yào diǎn shén me",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Waiter: Hello. What would you like to order?"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "本：要这两个菜，再要一个米饭。",
      "traditional": "本：要這兩個菜，再要一個米飯。",
      "pinyin": "běn yào zhè liǎng ge cài zài yào yí ge mǐ fàn",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: These two dishes, and a bowl of rice."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "服务员：好的，请稍等！",
      "traditional": "服務員：好的，請稍等！",
      "pinyin": "fú wù yuán hǎo de qǐng shāo děng",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Waiter: Ok, please wait a moment."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "（吃完饭后……）",
      "traditional": "（吃完飯後……）",
      "pinyin": "chī wán fàn hòu",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "(After the meal…)"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "本：服务员，买单。",
      "traditional": "本：服務員，買單。",
      "pinyin": "běn fú wù yuán mǎi dān",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: Waiter, the bill, please."
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "服务员：您好，一共80块。",
      "traditional": "服務員：您好，一共80塊。",
      "pinyin": "fú wù yuán nín hǎo yí gòng 2 kuài",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Waiter: Hello. It’s 80 yuan altogether."
    }
  ],
